  "h1": "Simple Invoice Template (Excel, Word and PDF)",
  "metaTitle": "Simple Invoice Template: Free Excel, Word & PDF",
  "metaDescription": "Free simple invoice template in Excel, Word and PDF. Line totals, tax and grand total calculate automatically. Edit, print or email. No sign-up.",
  "short": "Clean one-page invoice. Excel version adds line totals, tax and grand total for you.",
  "accent": "#047857",
